Amstrad CPC 6128 ROMs: cpc6128.rom (OS and BASIC 1.1), amsdos.rom

These are the original ROMs of the Amstrad CPC 6128, copyright Amstrad
Consumer Electronics plc and Locomotive Software Ltd (1985); AMSDOS also
carries work of Digital Research. They are not under this repository's
licence.

Amstrad have kindly given their permission for the redistribution of their
copyrighted material but retain that copyright.

The permission (Cliff Lawson, Amstrad plc, comp.sys.sinclair, 1999) allows
emulators to include the ROM images as long as the copyright messages are
not altered, and nobody may charge for the ROM code. For the parts that
are also Locomotive's, Cliff Lawson said their permission would be needed
too, though he did not think they would object. The emulator and these
ROMs are given away free of charge.

The files are the ones the Caprice32 emulator ships (rom/cpc6128.rom,
rom/amsdos.rom).
